<section id="bbs021" image-layout="blank"><card-template-instructions>Screenshot beside text: a working title and a short paragraph on the left, a framed landscape screenshot plate on the right with a surface strip standing in for the window chrome.</card-template-instructions><grid spacing="medium"><grid-item colspan="24" vertical-align="center" id="Wf0F-HDGSP"><h2>One view of every scheduled delivery</h2><p>The schedule board shows each standing account, its delivery day and the reserved stock, so a missed delivery or a quantity drift is visible the same morning rather than at the monthly review.</p><p>Account managers update it from the road; operations reads it at the start of each shift.</p></grid-item><grid-item colspan="36" padding="0" cell-style="subtle" id="YNUaYTD9yL"><grid spacing="none" direction="vertical"><grid-item rowspan="6" padding="10pt 14pt" background-color="surface" id="uX5D5FnBKk"><p font-size="sm">schedule.northwind.example</p></grid-item><grid-item rowspan="54" padding="0" id="kAq-mO_K_W"><img meta="{&quot;width&quot;:2048,&quot;height&quot;:1152}" alt="Clean software dashboard screenshot showing a weekly delivery schedule board with rows of accounts, a small line chart and status chips, light interface, no readable text" image-style="none" background="true" source="image.ai-generated" saved-media-id="m4tga9smz1m3swc" src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/gammatemplatelibrary/g_hdwa21xzz00ppa2/template-assets/7c4c21e8265595fe39b012381769f29e/J51NgS0YqvubHcXB.jpg"></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>